{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0642_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "0f1d98ef48bb0597da24937d13bb62ee81ee0544707a2b4693792667ea16f44a", "ja": "あら、{$P$}くん……\n顔色が悪いわよ？　大丈夫？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}，你的脸色不太好哦？没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0642_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ed6443e267e4bddc501940be411f140681239384fba0b7dee24e8e9efc52f419", "ja": "えっ、そうか？\n体調は普通だし、元気なつもりだけど……。", "zh": "诶，是吗？\n我的身体状况很正常，自我感觉也挺精神的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0642_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "96bd8436603658753a77c06c7c12eae5ae493abaa46e01a4513d443052b4ef74", "ja": "ううん、絶対、熱があるわ！\nほら。私が測ってあげるから、おでこ貸して？", "zh": "不对，你绝对是发烧了！\n来，我帮你量一下，把额头靠过来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0642_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8c3a02ffe7a96a2ff0d618517bbb0beb858eaa239b02673e65a03365bf056f90", "ja": "はは、そんなことしなくても大丈夫だって。\n救急箱に体温計が……。", "zh": "哈哈，不用做那种事也没关系。\n急救箱里有体温计……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0642_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d705ade18485e68916e37348fca9a331366b90cd837357bcf8fbdbe105bdb6ce", "ja": "なあ、莉緒？　またなにか企んでないか？", "zh": "喂，莉绪？你是不是又在打什么主意？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0642_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "14e3e154e7ea1e326b5683e78bf86a63e93f628d1ba8b93dc8f1089a89c1baf7", "ja": "そ、そんなことないわよ？　……男子は女子の看病に\nドキドキするっていうから、実践してみようかなって。", "zh": "没、没那回事啦？……听说男生在照顾女生时会心跳加速，所以我就想实践一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0642_1006_p", "source_sha256": "acd80371640f012df542ef3c3dba2fd214839b982c0b5bfa9d38fbb423d3b19f", "ja": "はあ～。そういうのはせめて\n本当に体調が悪くなった時に……はくしゅん！", "zh": "唉～。这种事至少也要等到\n真的身体不舒服的时候……阿嚏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0642_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "aa64d82df11f85a4c571321ba84bf5eaebc2acb78a48b88c724affa1daa7ad80", "ja": "ええっ！？　やだちょっと、本当に体調が悪いんじゃ\nない？　…とりあえず仮眠室で横になりましょう！", "zh": "咦！？等一下，你不会是真的身体不舒服吧？……总之先去休息室躺一会儿吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0642_1008_p", "source_sha256": "215a21a2ba766ff72bd87711e5f1907d29e20ea90095ecdea4296d7574cb8b03", "ja": "いや、今のは鼻がムズムズしただけで……。", "zh": "不是，刚才只是鼻子有点发痒……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0642_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "94599324b679a61ee76694a5ad2eabc15f2ce442f6b4fd36e9bd349b711c1c1d", "ja": "いいから、私に任せて！　ほらほら、早く移動して。\n薬は……そうだ。風花ちゃんに聞いてみようかしら？", "zh": "总之，交给我吧！来来，快点换个地方。\n药的话……对了。去问问风花吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0642_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0642_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a810c9901c731c35a4bf27c3daf4ebf4c1ed1dde690f401c77588658f16a31a3", "ja": "（その後、仮眠室で一時間ほど眠った。起きたら\n莉緒の姿はなかったが、体はだいぶ楽になったな！）", "zh": "（之后，我在午休室睡了大约一个小时。醒来后虽然已经看不到莉绪了，但身体轻松多了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
